      "message": "[error] Line 75: 🔴 `accountMetadata` decode failures are now silently ignored (`decode(...)` returning nullopt just leaves `metadata` empty), so a malformed/tampered archive is accepted as a successful import with metadata dropped. That is a silent data-loss/integrity regression for LWW tombstones and can reintroduce stale state after sync. Treat a present-but-undecodable `accountMetadata` field as an import error (fail deserialization), while still allowing archives where the field is absent for backward compatibility.",
